###############################################################################
#                           AUTHORIZATION NOTES                              #
###############################################################################
#
# All campaign endpoints require:
# 1. Valid Bearer token (user must be authenticated)
# 2. Verified email address (emailStatus = VERIFIED)
# 3. Approved KYC profile (kycStatus = APPROVED)
#
# Middleware Chain:
# - requireAuth: Validates JWT token
# - requireVerifiedEmail: Checks if user's email is verified
# - requireApprovedKYC: Checks if user's KYC is approved
#
###############################################################################

###############################################################################
#                        FILE UPLOAD DETAILS                                 #
###############################################################################
#
# Upload Directory Structure:
# uploads/
# └── campaigns/
#     └── {campaignId}/
#         ├── cover-image.ext
#         ├── proof-file-1.ext
#         └── proof-file-N.ext
#
# Supported File Types:
# Images: JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF (cover image max 5MB)
# Videos: MP4, WebM, QuickTime (proof files max 20MB)
# Documents: PDF, DOC, DOCX (proof files max 20MB)
#
# Database Storage:
# - Relative paths are stored in database (e.g., 'campaigns/uuid/file.jpg')
# - Complete URLs are generated in API responses
# - URLs can be accessed via: http://localhost:3000/uploads/campaigns/{id}/file.ext
#
###############################################################################

###############################################################################
#                           ENGAGEMENT METRICS                               #
###############################################################################
#
# Campaign Engagement Tracking:
#
# donationCount:
#   - Incremented each time someone makes a donation to the campaign
#   - Displayed as total number of donations
#
# shareCount:
#   - Incremented each time campaign is shared on social media
#   - Helps identify viral campaigns
#   - Can be used for gamification/rewards
#
# viewCount:
#   - Incremented each time campaign details are viewed
#   - Tracks campaign popularity and visibility
#   - Useful for analytics and recommendations
#
###############################################################################
